; PLAN_liquid_types.md L2: the Liquid Austral refinement AST (`LiquidTypes`),
; the TRL contract-string parser (`LiquidParse`), and the `liquid` compiler
; pass (`LiquidCheck`).
;
; This is a separate library rather than more `austral_core` modules because the
; pass sits on the `Compiler_plugin` seam, which `austral_lib` owns: `austral`
; the library depends on `austral_liquid`, which depends on `austral_core`.
; `LiquidCheck` reaches `Compiler_plugin.verdict`, so it cannot live *inside*
; `austral_core` without a cycle.
(library
 (name austral_liquid)
 (public_name austral.austral_liquid)
 (synopsis "Liquid Austral: refinement types for the Total Austral Subset.")
 (libraries austral_core zarith str)
 (wrapped false)
 (flags :standard -w -39-50)
 (modules LiquidTypes LiquidParse LiquidConstraints LiquidWhy3 TotalityCheck LiquidCheck))